  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8c1a70fcd7e8f8c42920e122a812509f, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryData 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  sprites:
  - {fileID: -8601889791981460492, guid: 577acb6b0e33ab14d8559f0cfff8bf0f, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 4012241421315033362, guid: 4fb5e535fb0f21f47820a8ca4f9002a1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 5001214173743697840, guid: a21c8e6ac8bacda46bae538667e9c86e, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -8670943121648922643, guid: 291c5d7ac9557774f82532cad7499999, type: 3}
  dialogues:
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha hauled her supply cart to the black market alone. The merchant
        inspected the blades and counted out a few coins.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uB294 \uD63C\uC790 \uBCF4\uAE09 \uC218\uB808\uB97C
        \uB04C\uACE0 \uC554\uC2DC\uC7A5\uC5D0 \uC654\uB2E4. \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740
        \uAC80\uC744 \uC774\uB9AC\uC800\uB9AC \uC0B4\uD3B4\uBCF4\uBA70 \uB3D9\uC804\uC744
        \uC138\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: Not bad for a beginner. I'll take them.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uCD08\uBCF4\uCE58\uACE4 \uC81C\uBC95\uC778\uB370? \uC774 \uC815\uB3C4\uBA74
        \uC0AC \uC8FC\uC9C0."
  - nextImage: 1
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: The key's price had somehow gone up. The merchant pushed a sack of
        flour across the counter.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC5F4\uC1E0\uAC12\uC740 \uC5B4\uB290\uC0C8 \uB354 \uC62C\uB77C
        \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uBC00\uAC00\uB8E8 \uC790\uB8E8\uB97C
        \uBC00\uC5B4 \uB193\uC558\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: Enough weapons. Bring me bread this time.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uBB34\uAE30\uB294 \uCDA9\uBD84\uD574. \uC774\uBC88\uC5D4 \uBE75\uC744
        \uAC00\uC838\uC640."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha set off to find Cherry the cook.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uB294 \uC694\uB9AC\uC0AC \uCCB4\uB9AC\uB97C \uCC3E\uC544\uAC00\uAE30\uB85C
        \uD588\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 1
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Cherry was building a little oven, but enemies kept rushing at her
        dough and interrupting her work.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uCCB4\uB9AC\uB294 \uC791\uC740 \uD654\uB355\uC744 \uC313\uACE0
        \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC801\uB4E4\uC774 \uBC18\uC8FD\uC5D0
        \uB2EC\uB824\uB4E4\uC5B4 \uC77C\uC190\uC744 \uB193\uAE30 \uC77C\uC464\uC600\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Cherry
      dialogue: If I could just finish the oven, I could bake!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uCCB4\uB9AC"
      dialogue: "\uD654\uB355\uB9CC \uC644\uC131\uD558\uBA74 \uBE75\uC744 \uAD6C\uC6B8
        \uC218 \uC788\uB294\uB370!"
  - nextImage: 1
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: With Mocha guarding the clearing, Cherry finished the chimney and
        lit the fire. The smell of fresh bread filled the air.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00 \uC55E\uC744 \uC9C0\uD0A4\uC790 \uCCB4\uB9AC\uB294
        \uAD74\uB69D\uC744 \uC62C\uB9AC\uACE0 \uBD88\uC744 \uD53C\uC6E0\uB2E4. \uD654\uB355\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uACE0\uC18C\uD55C \uB0C4\uC0C8\uAC00 \uD37C\uC84C\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Cherry
      dialogue: With you watching my back, I can bake twice as much!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uCCB4\uB9AC"
      dialogue: "\uB124\uAC00 \uC9C0\uCF1C \uC8FC\uBA74 \uB450 \uD310\uB3C4 \uAD6C\uC6B8
        \uC218 \uC788\uC5B4!"
